    "RowId": 12691,
    "Text": "Silence Echo"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 12692,
    "Text": "Enabling this setting will prevent Echo bonuses from being granted.\n<span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">※Can only be selected when using a preformed party meeting party size requirements or an unrestricted party.\n※Only the party leader's settings are applicable.\n</span>"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 12693,
    "Text": "Set the way in which loot is distributed.\n\n<span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Normal\n</span>The Need, Greed, Pass system is employed for loot drops.\n\n<span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Greed Only\n</span>All party members must select Greed or Pass.\n\n<span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Lootmaster\n</span>The party leader determines individual loot distribution.\n\n<span style=\"color: #ff8080;\">※Greed Only and Lootmaster can only be selected when using a preformed party meeting party size requirements or an unrestricted party.\n※Loot rules may be restricted to Greed Only on certain duties.\n※Loot rules cannot be changed on certain duties.\n※Only the party leader can change loot rules.</span>"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 12694,
    "Text": "You will be matched with players who are using the selected languages.\n\n<span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">※Depending on the languages chosen, matching times may increase. If you are experiencing overlong wait times, you may want to consider different language settings.\n</span>\n<span style=\"color: #ff8080;\">※The _ indicates your current client language setting.\n※This setting is shared in all duty matching, though please be aware that it may not apply to certain Gold Saucer activities.</span>"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 12695,
    "Text": "Not available in New Game+ mode."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 12696,
    "Text": "Level Sync"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 12697,
    "Text": "Sync all participants to a duty's required level.\n<span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">※When using an unrestricted party, gear will still gain spiritbond.\n※When using an unrestricted party, enemies will still yield EXP and items.</span>\n<span style=\"color: #ff8080;\">※Can only be selected when using an unrestricted party.\n※Only the party leader's settings are applicable.</span>"
  },
